WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.174
Required from optional.

00:00:02.174 --> 00:00:04.158
Passing from failing.

00:00:04.158 --> 00:00:06.332
Signal from decoration.

00:00:06.332 --> 00:00:13.136
You spent this room telling things apart, and never once by color alone.

00:00:13.136 --> 00:00:18.901
Name the discipline, one word, and the chamber is mine again.
